  "description": "Drunk after her latest heartbreak, lazy game addict Sylvia buys a mysterious game called V-Card Raider. However, before she even gets to play, she dies of alcohol poisoning and finds herself transported into the game world. There, she is told by a god that she is on the fast track to hell unless she sleeps with the main characters, collects the seeds of the World Tree, and saves the game universe! Is there a catch? Who cares?! Who wouldn't want to enter heaven by committing the sin of lust?\n\n(Source: Tapas)",
